{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20571","headline":"同将作韦二少监赠水部李郎中 · 张籍","name":"同将作韦二少监赠水部李郎中","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"旧年同是水曹郎，各罢鱼符自楚乡。\n重着青衫承诏命，齐趋紫殿异班行。\n别来同说经过事，老去相传补养方。\n忆得当时亦连步，如今独在读书堂。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张籍","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20571.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20571","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}